\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nAlbert and his dad made a deal. If Albert managed to graduate, being in the top 5 in the school, his dad would buy him a new laptop. If Albert lost, then he would not get anything. During the announcement, Albert fell short of the list and was ranked 6. The next day, they found out that one of the top 5 contestants had cheated and was disqualified.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Albert ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Jealousy\nB) Embarrassment\nC) Nervousness\nD) Delight\nE) Disapproval\nF) Guilt\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Albert feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) He proved his father right\nB) His father was going to buy him a new laptop\nC) Because one of the top 5 contestants cheated and was disqualified, this put him in the top 5\nD) He was named in the top 6","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00757379515816971,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a5d6006945d2809e6a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369701004,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"447bb84c5ce64d33bef4d4531d5f4e64"}